Revision history for Bijection-XS

0.12    2026-11-04
        - Test offset_set, a set with a zero or negative first argument, and what import
          passes on; the XS is at 100% coverage under Devel::XSCover on clang and gcc 14
        - Add a MANIFEST.SKIP, so the manifest test passes in a git clone

0.11    2026-10-23
        - Export with Ex::Op instead of Import::Export, perl 5.10 or later

0.01    Date/time
        First version, released on an unsuspecting world.

